(AUDIENCE CHEERS, APPLAUDS)

00:06:05.031 --> 00:06:07.900
Okay, uh, well, the US
right to freeze access

00:06:07.966 --> 00:06:10.703
to the six billion in funds
it transferred to Iran

00:06:10.770 --> 00:06:12.772
as part of the prisoner deal
we negotiated--

00:06:12.838 --> 00:06:14.740
-Oh, was the US right
to freeze that...
-JAMES: Yes

00:06:14.873 --> 00:06:16.075
...we negotiated last month?

00:06:16.308 --> 00:06:18.577
Okay, so if people don't know,
we wanted to get

00:06:18.710 --> 00:06:20.946
-how many people back? Five?
-Five. We got them back.

00:06:21.013 --> 00:06:22.414
We got them back
and we paid

00:06:22.614 --> 00:06:23.782
-six billion dollars.
-JAMES: Six billion dollars.

00:06:23.849 --> 00:06:25.117
We didn't pay it. It was money
that...

00:06:25.184 --> 00:06:26.418
-BILL: Yes. Okay.
-JAMES: ...was owed to Ukraine--

00:06:26.485 --> 00:06:27.853
MATT: No, it was Iran's money...

00:06:27.920 --> 00:06:29.388
-...from oil
that had been sanctioned.
-Sold to South Korea.

00:06:29.521 --> 00:06:32.792
Okay, but we made the deal,
we got the people back,

00:06:32.958 --> 00:06:34.526
and now we're not giving them
the money.

00:06:34.693 --> 00:06:36.729
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)

00:06:37.196 --> 00:06:40.266
I mean, I'm not-- (LAUGHS)

00:06:40.599 --> 00:06:43.936
I'm not... (CHUCKLES) ...taking
Iran's side in this,

00:06:44.336 --> 00:06:45.871
but you know
we did have a deal.

00:06:45.938 --> 00:06:47.939
I mean, we have a history
of breaking deals with Iran,

00:06:48.006 --> 00:06:49.175
-unfortunately, but...
-BILL: With everybody.

00:06:49.308 --> 00:06:52.177
The charge was made that,
you know, I think, Tim Scott

00:06:52.311 --> 00:06:54.080
and others made this
completely demagogic,

00:06:54.180 --> 00:06:55.615
you know, false claim
that, you know,

00:06:55.681 --> 00:06:59.652
this money helped to fund
the attacks we saw last weekend

00:06:59.719 --> 00:07:01.620
which is absurd
for a number of reasons,

00:07:01.687 --> 00:07:04.190
not least of which is this--
None of this money

00:07:04.256 --> 00:07:05.824
had been dispersed yet.

00:07:06.058 --> 00:07:07.193
They haven't seen
a cent of it.

00:07:07.259 --> 00:07:10.129
But there's a larger point
that we should have maintained

00:07:10.195 --> 00:07:12.431
the pressure campaign
on Iran that

00:07:12.498 --> 00:07:13.966
the Trump Administration started

00:07:14.299 --> 00:07:15.868
and that, that was rolled
and dialed back

00:07:15.935 --> 00:07:18.604
by the Biden Administration
and it has allowed--

00:07:18.738 --> 00:07:20.273
That's really not true.
They've kept in

00:07:20.339 --> 00:07:22.074
-almost every element...
-They have not maintained--

00:07:22.207 --> 00:07:23.709
...of the Trump--
No, they absolutely have.

00:07:23.809 --> 00:07:25.878
What we should have done
is cap the deal Obama made.

00:07:26.011 --> 00:07:27.613
MATT: Right, that's exactly
what we should have done.

00:07:27.780 --> 00:07:28.847
-No?
-No way.

00:07:28.914 --> 00:07:29.915
-No.
-No way.

00:07:30.049 --> 00:07:33.418
This regime--
This Iranian regime,
how can you make

00:07:33.652 --> 00:07:35.187
a deal with this Iranian regime?

00:07:35.254 --> 00:07:36.589
Well, if you have a deal
