make that fucking deal.

00:07:38.357 --> 00:07:40.659
-And they did. And they--
Obama made that deal.
-MATT: That's right.

00:07:40.725 --> 00:07:42.395
I mean, it was like this...

00:07:43.262 --> 00:07:45.264
With a sunset clause
of 12 years, okay?

00:07:45.331 --> 00:07:46.666
So, it was just postponed
by 12 years,

00:07:46.732 --> 00:07:47.933
the date that they got
a nuclear weapon.

00:07:48.100 --> 00:07:49.835
Okay, well, nothing--
No deal is perfect.

00:07:49.935 --> 00:07:51.671
Isn't that what we're saying
about the Palestinians

00:07:51.737 --> 00:07:52.872
-with the West Bank?
-MATT: That's right.

00:07:52.938 --> 00:07:55.808
They could have had
their own country many times.

00:07:55.975 --> 00:07:58.044
Not many times, but a few times.
Certainly in 2000.

00:07:58.110 --> 00:08:00.512
Then again, there are deals
that Israel could have taken
and didn't.

00:08:00.579 --> 00:08:03.716
Right. They could have had
97 percent of the West Bank

00:08:03.849 --> 00:08:06.252
but they-- It was not perfect,
as no deal is,

00:08:06.452 --> 00:08:08.553
because Israel was not
about to give it to them

00:08:08.620 --> 00:08:10.389
just say, "Oh, you know what,
do your thing."

00:08:10.489 --> 00:08:12.925
They were like, "Yes,
we have to keep an eye on you,

00:08:12.991 --> 00:08:14.093
for very good reason."

00:08:14.560 --> 00:08:17.062
But over time
if they had taken that deal,

00:08:17.162 --> 00:08:20.466
where would the world be today
in 2023, if there had been a--

00:08:20.900 --> 00:08:24.069
if Arafat had taken that deal
and in 2000 there was state?

00:08:24.136 --> 00:08:26.505
Yes, then you show Israel
we're not out to get--

00:08:26.572 --> 00:08:28.374
MATT: Yeah, somehow we got back
to Israel-Palestine, uh,

00:08:28.707 --> 00:08:30.309
-from Iran.
-BILL: Okay.

00:08:30.643 --> 00:08:33.279
But I'll just get back
to the Iran deal for a minute.

00:08:33.379 --> 00:08:35.947
I think, important to understand
about this six billion

00:08:36.047 --> 00:08:37.282
is that it was going to be--

00:08:37.516 --> 00:08:40.919 line:0%
is handled and held by Qatar
and was going to be spent

00:08:40.986 --> 00:08:44.490 line:0%
